cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PINN Learning Path: from neural networks to physics-informed neural networks"
message: "If you use this learning path, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Toffia
    given-names: Mario
repository-code: "https://github.com/mariotoffia/pinn"
url: "https://mariotoffia.github.io/pinn/"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained, plain-English learning path taking a reader from basic
  neural networks to building, training, debugging and critically evaluating
  Physics-Informed Neural Networks. Includes an offline single-file hub with
  guided interactive tours, a CPU/float64 PyTorch starter kit, and marimo lab
  notebooks.
keywords:
  - physics-informed neural networks
  - scientific machine learning
  - automatic differentiation
  - partial differential equations
  - education
license: Apache-2.0
